1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
There are two distinct things.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,500
One, you actually have to train the brain because the brain is biased to seek certainty.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,300
It wants to be right.

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:12,300
It's survival value that's been built into our system for six million years.

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:17,000
And ultimately what you have to do is you have to retrain the brain so that it's more probability-based.

6
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,900
So that you're no longer looking, you're actually managing uncertainty.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,600
You have a mindset that manages uncertainty to be able to build probability rather than to look for certainty.

8
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,200
Completely different animals.

9
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,200
But people hate to be wrong.

10
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,900
So how do we retrain our brains to look for probability?

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,300
People have to change the way their minds work if they're going to become a competent trader.

12
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,000
Is that our brain grows up with this bias.

13
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,200
It grows up in families.

14
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,500
It grows up in cultures.

15
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:50,300
And we're even graded in school about taking losses.

16
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,100
We want to make the best grade.

17
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,500
We don't want to have any losses.

18
00:00:53,800 --> 00:01:00,900
And we get trained like that, and we take that mind into trading, and it blows us up because you are no longer working with certainty.

19
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,400
You are working with probability at that time.
